ived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-01T23:42:22Z","updated_at":"2026-08-02T23:59:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.7.1.stable.official [a13da4feb]\n\n### System information\n\nWeb IOS (Iphone or Ipad) (safari and chrome)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe application will freeze completely if a tween in done on the font_size of a label. The same hang happens using any of these methods to set the font size: `theme_override_font_sizes/font_size`, `get_theme().default_font_size` and `get_label_settings().font_size`\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a Label Node.\n- Attach a Script to it.\n- Create a Tween in _ready().\n-Tween any of the font size properties for 1 second, for example: `tween.tween_property($LabelThemeOverride, \"theme_override_font_sizes/font_size\", 100, 1.0)`\n- Execute the application in a web browser on an ios device (Iphone or Ipad)\n- The application will freeze.\n\nNote: Sometimes the crash might happen after the font size has been tweening for a little bit, set the tween to loop for easier repro. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[web-ios-font-size-tween-crash.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30624593/web-ios-font-size-tween-crash.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122019/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122019/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}